This entry will only be identified by the path where it is found on your system ("%1"). No more specific means of identification (UUID, label) is available.
It is not possible on your system to identify the storage medium of this path. It will be added using the file path as the only identifier. This will work well for your local hard disk.
There is already a collection for a network share with the same path.
The network share will be identified by the path you selected. If the path is empty, the share will be considered unavailable.
