List of message part types to strip off mails that are being forwarded inline.
Show the Text Snippet Management and Insertion Panel in the composer.
The maximum size in MB that email attachments are allowed to have (-1 for no limit).
Show the GnuPG Audit Log even after crypto operations that completed successfully.
