IPMT(Rate; Period; NPer; PV; FV; Type)
IPMT(0.1; 3; 3; 8000) equals -292.45
Present values (PV)
Calculates the interest paid on a given period of an investment.
ISPMT(Rate; Period; NPer; PV)
ISPMT(0.1; 1; 3; 8000000) equals -533333
