VARA(value; value;...)
VARA(12; 5; 7) equals 13
VARA(15; 80; 3) equals 1716.333...
VARA(6; 7; 8) equals 1
The VARIANCE() function calculates the estimates variance based on a sample. It's the same as the VAR function.
